    "body": "Universal ASH* remains open for stacking and clearing. S004 proves an almost-stacked non-stackable witness of mass 3k for every independent set of size k>=2, allowing edges outside that independent set. With credited source threshold formulas, this establishes ASH* for all complete multipartite graphs. Novelty and Lean certification are not claimed.\n\nThe independent cold audit confirms the printed P4/bull counterexamples, true thresholds 15, and required smallest-order boundaries. Printed-form mathematics Phase 1 passes separately; universal mathematics remains in progress. No later stage or external contact occurred.\n\nComplete sparse losing-layer certificates resolve all eight missing order-seven stacking and three clearing cases. Combined with S003, all 853/853 stacking and 809/809 clearing thresholds at order seven are independently complete. Selected larger values: C9 37/46, triangle with a length-five tail stack 128, two triangles joined by a length-three path 36/36. C10 is complete only through mass 16; triangle-tail clear >140 remains undetermined. All 21 certificates, including cutoffs, were independently replayed, covering 11,726,545 losing states.\n\nValidation: cold full reverse winning DP and forward closure; original winning-sequence and closed-set replay; 233 independent-set witness tests; full reverse winning base comparison on all 21 cases; independent packed canonical-parent completeness replay; governance, source/claim mirrors and 65 evidence/code hashes. The workflow repeats these checks. Failed extremal, block, invariant and algebraic assumptions are documented, with a complete strictly FUTURE S005 handoff.\n\nAtomic publication: remote authored head 22e08b27dca04d5ab9d62ac7116a6f31cc8da889; parent e7d0c793df056935c83c76f526da46fb3beb427d; tree 394b993924907a0240eee884c4e9753d55ddf375. Command-line push had no write credentials, so the connected GitHub API uploaded the reviewed tree; its SHA exactly matches the locally verified tree (local preparatory commit dac71e0f49cd637f122c2a119955655639e6cb35 was not pushed). Exactly one authored commit is proposed to main. Actual hosted check and merge/main results are recorded below.\n\nVerified session transaction (2026-10-13)\n\n- Authored head: `22e08b27dca04d5ab9d62ac7116a6f31cc8da889`, single parent `e7d0c793df056935c83c76f526da46fb3beb427d`.\n- Reviewed/published tree: `394b993924907a0240eee884c4e9753d55ddf375`, identical to the locally audited tree.\n- Ordinary non-force two-parent merge and independently re-read main: `9af432b717a1c742a9bed4708980ba7adf2da08d`, parents exactly the entry main and authored head.\n- PR hosted run [38448028484](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38448028484): completed SUCCESS; validate job `115471438478`, including the full certificate replay.\n- Main hosted run [38448532562](https://github.com/jfairfaxball-348/Almost-Stacked-Proof/actions/runs/38448532562): completed SUCCESS; validate/check `115473173017`, all steps success. Checked after merge, not inferred from PR status.\n- Independently fetched merged main into a separate checkout; repeated governance/hash verification, cold printed audit, structural/sequence/closure replay, all 233 independent-set tests, and complete full-winning base comparisons on all 21 cases. Clean checkout; exact merge parents/tree re-pinned from both Git and API.\n- Branch protection UNKNOWN (403), ruleset list empty as observed; absent traditional status contexts were not labelled a passing check.\n- S005 prompt is installed as strictly FUTURE/UNEXECUTED. Universal ASH* remains OPEN for both goals. No Lean, novelty priority claim, external contact, Palomar or arXiv action.\n\nThis transaction record completes the frozen `sessions/S004/CLOSEOUT.md` publication-verification obligation without a second authored session commit.",
